","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-4","ASM-18"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The user selects Arabic","id":"AC-REQ-29.1","level":"ui","then":"the screen and certificate display Arabic content with right-to-left direction for tables and charts","when":"the portal and a delivery certificate are displayed"},{"given":"The user's account has a configured time zone","id":"AC-REQ-29.2","level":"ui","then":"the screen displays the values in that configured time zone","when":"the portal displays order or delivery dates and times"}],"ears":"The Meridian web app shall present the customer portal and certificates in the user's selected English or Arabic, render Arabic right to left including tables and charts, and show dates and times in the account's configured time zone.","id":"REQ-29","op":"ADDED","sources":["ASM-6","ASM-16","ASM-18","I-13","I-15","I-17","I-18","I-19","I-20","I-50"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Audit entries are returned for multiple records, users, dates, and action types","id":"AC-REQ-30.1","level":"ui","then":"the screen displays each entry's actor, time, changed fields, old and new values, and supplied reason","when":"an Auditor opens the audit trail"},{"given":"An Auditor selects audit filters","id":"AC-REQ-30.2","level":"ui","then":"the screen displays the matching returned list and provides a file containing the filtered view","when":"the filters are applied and the Auditor exports the view"}],"ears":"The Meridian web app shall provide an audit-trail screen showing returned entries with actor, time, changed fields, old and new values, and supplied reason, with filters by record, user, date range, and action type and export of the filtered view.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-4","I-13","I-15","I-17","I-18","I-19","I-20"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A lot-history response contains receipt, movement, delivery, or destruction events","id":"AC-REQ-31.1","level":"ui","then":"the screen displays the returned events in t